apologies, thanks, suggestions and invitations in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le09ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Thanking and Responding to Thanks"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you are in a formal situation, remember to thank people when they do something for you, and remember to use the Simple Present tense.<br><br>You respond to thanks with expressions like <span class=\"italic\">You're welcome </span> or <span class=\"italic\">My pleasure</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Thanking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to thanks\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Thank you so much! <br>You saved my life!<br>I owe you one! (less formal)</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My pleasure.<br> You're welcome.<br> No worries. (less formal) </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I owe you one!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Thank you very much! I must return the favor. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Thank you for the new bag. I owe you one!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use in an airport."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "No worries! "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "You're welcome!"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Ann: Thank you so much! Bob: No worries."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "perks"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "things or services you receive with a card, usually free or at a reduced price"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This frequent flyer card gives me so many perks!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "reward"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "points you get when you spend money on a card"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: With the points on my reward card, I can get a bag for free!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "frequent flyer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a reward program for travelers who fly often"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am a frequent flyer with American Airways."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I didn't catch that"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I didn't understand what you said."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Could you repeat please? I didn't catch that."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "You saved my life!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Thank you so much!"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I made it just in time! Thanks! You saved my life!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking Someone to Repeat"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use modal verbs like  <span class=\"strong\">can</span>, <span class=\"strong\">could</span> or <span class=\"strong\">would</span> to ask someone to repeat something. Look at the following examples:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm sorry, <span class=\"strong\">could</span> you repeat that, please?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Would</span> you say that again, please?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Can</span> you repeat that, please?"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of 5 items you like to pack when you go on holiday."}, {"type": "text", "content": "What are they? "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Why do you need to travel with them?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write one sentence for each item."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your list with your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about packing for travel."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make a list of things I need to pack."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express in writing and aloud why I need some things for traveling."}]}], "type": "sena"}